        <description>Detmines the security mode to apply to the Utilization Dataset</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Select the security mode to apply to the Utilization Dataset. If Individual is selected, the security is applied to allow resources to access their own data only. If Hierarchy is selected, access will also be provided to the resource&apos;s manager based on the field selected in Hierarchy Mode.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Utilization Results Security Mode</label>
